Description: dashboard: --allow-host to accept a reverse-proxied Host header
 The dashboard rejects any Host header other than 127.0.0.1:PORT/localhost:PORT
 (DNS-rebinding protection). A team server exposes it through a reverse proxy
 under a real hostname, so allow the operator to list extra acceptable Host
 values; POST origin checks accept http or https for those hosts.
Author: Roman <roman@nekko.ai>
Forwarded: no
